  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Correctly performs an exclusive or on two <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Base64" target="_blank">Base64</a> strings.</p>
  <p>Returns a string that is a Base64 XOR of <b>str1</b> and <b>str2</b>.</p>
</p>
